"KR3a0069-en-0ba9228d" src="AI - Gemini">Kǒngzǐ, when talking to people, said:</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-dd2ad4ab-7266-4ee9-a622-5790a96a6515" orig=""><orth>之</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">zhī</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-3c48510e-48f0-4252-8851-0e48f0d25232"><gramGrp><pos>N</pos><tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-20369602-1fc4-4a61-8b75-578be226d2aa">npropostN.adV:adS</tls:syn-func></gramGrp><def resp="#CH" updated="2024-06-27T16:20:29.857+09:00">孔子之仕於魯者“while Confucius was serving as an official in Lu": while</def></sense><tls:metadata resp="#CH" created="2026-03-17T21:25:11.483+09:00"><respStmt><resp>added</resp><name notBefore="2026-03-17T21:25:11.483+09:00">CH</name></respStmt></tls:metadata></tls:ann></seg><seg xml:id="KR3a0069_tls_009-163a.26"><line>「行孔子之言也。」</line><tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="GENITIVE PARTICLES" concept-id="uuid-8ffa4531-1f93-473b-b468-7d0cf9390af1" xml:id="uuid-eb12b2c6-d033-4a56-92b2-c6d0331a56fd"><link target="#KR3a0069_tls_009-163a.26 #uuid-21c30e1e-8b20-4a30-830e-1e8b20ca3006"/><tls:text><tls:srcline title="孔子集語" target="#KR3a0069_tls_009-163a.26" pos="5">「行孔子之言也。」</tls:srcline><tls:line title="Translation of 孔子集語 into (English)" transl-id="KR3a0069-en-0ba9228d" src="AI - Gemini">"Act according to Confucius's words."</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-dd2ad4ab-7266-4ee9-a622-5790a96a6515" orig=""><orth>之</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">zhī</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-21c30e1e-8b20-4a30-830e-1e8b20ca3006"><gramGrp><pos>N</pos><tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-e7001f27-725f-4f02-801f-27725f6f0237">npropostNpr.adV&gt;Nab</tls:syn-func><tls:sem-feat corresp="#uuid-ff006bd1-9958-4b0f-806b-d199584b0f13">Npr agent of nominalised V&gt;Nab</tls:sem-feat></gramGrp><def>孔子之窮於陳蔡之見"When Confucius was in straights between Chen and Cai."</def></sense><tls:metadata resp="#CH" created="2026-03-17T21:34:18.127+09:00"><respStmt><resp>added</resp><name notBefore="2026-03-17T21:34:18.127+09:00">CH</name></respStmt></tls:metadata></tls:ann><tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="GENITIVE PARTICLES" concept-id="uuid-8ffa4531-1f93-473b-b468-7d0cf9390af1" xml:id="uuid-523553fa-4ef1-4665-b553-fa4ef15665b1"><link target="#KR3a0069_tls_009-163a.26 #uuid-21c30e1e-8b20-4a30-830e-1e8b20ca3006"/><tls:text><tls:srcline title="孔子集語" target="#KR3a0069_tls_009-163a.26" pos="5">「行孔子之言也。」</tls:srcline><tls:line title="Translation of 孔子集語 into (English)" transl-id="KR3a0069-en-0ba9228d" src="AI - Gemini">"Act according to Confucius's words."</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-dd2ad4ab-7266-4ee9-a622-5790a96a6515" orig=""><orth>之</orth><pron xml:lang="zh-Latn-x-pinyin">zhī</pron></form><sense corresp="#uuid-21c30e1e-8b20-4a30-830e-1e8b20ca3006"><gramGrp><pos>N</pos><tls:syn-func corresp="#uuid-e7001f27-725f-4f02-801f-27725f6f0237">npropostNpr.adV&gt;Nab</tls:syn-func><tls:sem-feat corresp="#uuid-ff006bd1-9958-4b0f-806b-d199584b0f13">Npr agent of nominalised V&gt;Nab</tls:sem-feat></gramGrp><def resp="#CH" updated="2026-03-17T21:35:04.989+09:00">孔子之言“the words of Confucius"</def></sense><tls:metadata resp="#CH" created="2026-03-17T21:35:05.562+09:00"><respStmt><resp>added</resp><name notBefore="2026-03-17T21:35:05.562+09:00">CH</name></respStmt></tls:metadata></tls:ann></seg><seg xml:id="KR3a0069_tls_003-57a.65"><line>設卦以盡情偽，</line><tls:ann xmlns:tls="http://hxwd.org/ns/1.0" concept="TRUE" concept-id="uuid-5dfd2084-459d-4bd3-9a20-ca0f2f78db51" xml:id="uuid-de2dad5b-7361-48d1-adad-5b736158d188"><link target="#KR3a0069_tls_003-57a.65 #uuid-76266f53-37f5-4845-a66f-5337f59845dc"/><tls:text><tls:srcline title="孔子集語" target="#KR3a0069_tls_003-57a.65" pos="5">設卦以盡情偽，</tls:srcline><tls:line title="Translation of 孔子集語 into (English)" transl-id="KR3a0069-en-0ba9228d" src="AI - Gemini">set up the guà to fully express true and false intentions,</tls:line></tls:text><form corresp="#uuid-fe0dbc1f-2ca0-4174-9787-b9511e7f67fb #uuid-11aab8cc-d3c7-454c-8f8d-5714f315d3ed